        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Films: Robin Hood (1973 film), Oz the Great and Powerful, The Jungle Book, The Aristocats\n- People: Phil Harris, Sam Raimi, Joe Roth, David Lindsay-Abaire, Mitchell Kapner\n- Companies: Walt Disney Productions\n- Roles: Baloo, Thomas O'Malley, Little John\n\nFacts:\n- The Jungle Book is a 1967 film in which Phil Harris played Baloo the bear.\n- The Aristocats is a 1970 film in which Phil Harris played Thomas O'Malley.\n- Robin Hood is a 1973 American animated musical comedy-adventure film produced by Walt Disney Productions.\n- Robin Hood was first released in the United States on November 8, 1973.\n- Robin Hood is a 1973 film in which Phil Harris played Little John.\n- Oz the Great and Powerful is a 2013 American fantasy adventure film directed by Sam Raimi.\n- Oz the Great and Powerful was produced by Joe Roth.\n- Oz the Great and Powerful was written by David Lindsay-Abaire and Mitchell Kapner.",
